shi ta to o ku no ki mi wo mi ni i kun da</span></p><p begin="6.407" end="8.292" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.407" end="6.657">そ</span><span begin="6.657" end="6.813">の</span><span begin="6.813" end="7.171">後</span><span begin="7.171" end="7.385">は</span><span begin="7.385" end="7.708">どう</span><span begin="7.708" end="7.899">し</span><span begin="7.899" end="8.292">よう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那之后该怎么办呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so no a to wa do u shi yo u</span></p><p begin="8.738" end="10.808" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.738" end="9.175">きっ</span><span begin="9.175" end="9.282">と</span><span begin="9.282" end="9.652">君</span><span begin="9.652" end="9.905">に</span><span begin="9.905" end="10.005">は</span><span begin="10.005" end="10.269">言</span><span begin="10.269" end="10.392">え</span><span begin="10.392" end="10.808">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定无法对你说出口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki tto ki mi ni wa i e na i</span></p><p begin="34.709" end="39.964" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.709" end="35.028">幽</span><span begin="35.028" end="35.405">霊</span><span begin="35.405" end="35.625">に</span><span begin="35.625" end="35.972">なっ</span><span begin="35.972" end="36.106">た</span><span begin="36.106" end="36.500">僕</span><span begin="36.500" end="36.960">は、</span><span begin="37.149" end="37.528">夏</span><span begin="37.528" end="37.872">の終</span><span begin="37.872" end="38.097">わ</span><span begin="38.097" end="38.229">り</span><span begin="38.229" end="38.597">方</span><span begin="38.597" end="38.788">を</span><span begin="38.788" end="38.913">見</span><span begin="38.913" end="39.093">に</span><span begin="39.093" end="39.267">行</span><span begin="39.267" end="39.640">くん</span><span begin="39.640" end="39.964">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已是幽灵的我 要去见夏日的终末</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yu u re i ni na tta bo ku wa, na tsu no o wa ri ka ta wo mi ni i kun da</span></p><p begin="40.332" end="42.220" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.332" end="40.688">六</span><span begin="40.688" end="41.070">畳</span><span begin="41.070" end="41.288">の</span><span begin="41.288" end="41.439">地</span><span begin="41.439" end="41.726">球</span><span begin="41.726" end="42.220">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在六叠大的地球</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ro ku jo u no chi kyu u de</span></p><p begin="42.966" end="45.596" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.966" end="43.512">浅い</span><span begin="43.512" end="43.711">木</span><span begin="43.711" end="44.098">陰</span><span begin="44.098" end="44.224">の</span><span begin="44.224" end="44.456">バ</span><span begin="44.456" end="44.631">ス</span><span begin="44.631" end="45.281">停</span><span begin="45.281" end="45.596">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在浅浅树荫下的公交站</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a sa i ko ka ge no ba su te i de</span></p><p begin="45.983" end="48.225" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.983" end="46.334">夜</span><span begin="46.334" end="46.506">に</span><span begin="46.506" end="46.959">涼</span><span begin="46.959" end="47.268">む</span><span begin="47.268" end="47.642">君</span><span begin="47.642" end="47.780">の</span><span begin="47.780" end="48.225">手</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于夜纳凉的你的手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yo ru ni su zu mu ki mi no te</span></p><p begin="48.491" end="51.300" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.491" end="48.798">誘</span><span begin="48.798" end="48.995">蛾</span><span begin="48.995" end="49.408">灯</span><span begin="49.408" end="49.512">に</span><span begin="49.512" end="49.815">沿っ</span><span begin="49.815" end="50.037">て</span><span begin="50.037" end="50.420">石</span><span begin="50.420" end="50.584">を</span><span begin="50.584" end="50.955">蹴っ</span><span begin="50.955" end="51.300">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沿着诱蛾灯踢开石子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yu u ga to u ni so tte i shi wo ke tta</span></p><p begin="51.630" end="54.914" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.630" end="51.979">街</span><span begin="51.979" end="52.193">の</span><span begin="52.193" end="52.527">薄</span><span begin="52.527" end="52.708">明</span><span begin="52.708" end="52.935">か</span><span begin="52.935" end="53.082">り</span><span begin="53.082" end="53.413">が</span><span begin="53.413" end="53.780">揺</span><span begin="53.780" end="54.127">れ</span><span begin="54.127" end="54.342">てい</span><span begin="54.342" end="54.914">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">街道里薄弱灯火摇摇曳曳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ma chi no u su a ka ri ga yu re te i ru</span></p><p begin="55.867" end="1:00.929" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.867" end="57.281">何</span><span begin="57.281" end="57.982">も</span><span begin="57.982" end="58.696">見</span><span begin="58.696" end="59.400">え</span><span begin="59.400" end="59.835">な</span><span begin="59.835" end="1:00.004">く</span><span begin="1:00.004" end="1:00.418">たっ</span><span begin="1:00.418" end="1:00.929">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便什么也不能看见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na ni mo mi e na ku ta tte</span></p><p begin="1:01.517" end="1:06.479" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.517" end="1:02.928">何</span><span begin="1:02.928" end="1:03.636">も</span><span begin="1:03.636" end="1:04.339">言</span><span begin="1:04.339" end="1:05.048">わ</span><span begin="1:05.048" end="1:05.472">な</span><span begin="1:05.472" end="1:05.678">く</span><span begin="1:05.678" end="1:06.098">たっ</span><span begin="1:06.098" end="1:06.479">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便什么也说不出口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na ni mo i wa na ku ta tte</span></p><p begin="1:07.169" end="1:13.036" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.169" end="1:08.579">誰</span><span begin="1:08.579" end="1:09.245">も</span><span begin="1:09.245" end="1:09.956">気</span><span begin="1:09.956" end="1:10.711">付</span><span begin="1:10.711" end="1:11.302">か</span><span begin="1:11.302" end="1:11.754">な</span><span begin="1:11.754" end="1:12.111">く</span><span begin="1:12.111" end="1:12.706">たっ</span><span begin="1:12.706" end="1:13.036">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便谁也没能察觉到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">da re mo ki zu ka na ku ta tte</span></p><p begin="1:13.127" end="1:17.050" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.127" end="1:13.525">そ</span><span begin="1:13.525" end="1:13.891">れ</span><span begin="1:13.891" end="1:14.139">で</span><span begin="1:14.139" end="1:14.557">も</span><span begin="1:14.938" end="1:15.278">わ</span><span begin="1:15.278" end="1:15.639">か</span><span begin="1:15.639" end="1:16.351">る</span><span begin="1:16.351" end="1:16.690">か</span><span begin="1:16.690" end="1:17.050">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此我也明白的啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so re de mo wa ka ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="1:18.934" end="1:23.192" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.934" end="1:19.427">君</span><span begin="1:19.427" end="1:19.633">と</span><span begin="1:19.633" end="1:20.268">座っ</span><span begin="1:20.268" end="1:23.192">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你坐着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki mi to su wa tte</span></p><p begin="1:24.667" end="1:29.764" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.667" end="1:24.789">バ</span><span begin="1:24.789" end="1:25.070">ス</span><span begin="1:25.070" end="1:25.412">停</span><span begin="1:25.412" end="1:25.528">見</span><span begin="1:25.528" end="1:25.777">上</span><span begin="1:25.777" end="1:25.888">げ</span><span begin="1:25.888" end="1:26.081">た</span><span begin="1:26.081" end="1:26.572">空</span><span begin="1:26.572" end="1:27.264">が青い</span><span begin="1:27.264" end="1:27.516">こ</span><span begin="1:27.516" end="1:27.749">と</span><span begin="1:27.749" end="1:27.996">し</span><span begin="1:27.996" end="1:28.238">か</span><span begin="1:28.238" end="1:28.373">わ</span><span begin="1:28.373" end="1:28.711">か</span><span begin="1:28.711" end="1:29.060">ら</span><span begin="1:29.060" end="1:29.426">ず</span><span begin="1:29.426" end="1:29.764">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只知道公交站仰望的天空是如此湛蓝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ba su te i mi a ge ta so ra ga a o i ko to shi ka wa ka ra zu ni</span></p><p begin="1:30.328" end="1:34.452" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.328" end="1:30.701">雲</span><span begin="1:30.701" end="1:31.059">が</span><span begin="1:31.059" end="1:31.564">遠い</span><span begin="1:31.564" end="1:33.655">ね</span> <span begin="1:33.655" end="1:33.937">ね</span><span begin="1:33.937" end="1:34.452">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">云朵很遥远呐 话说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ku mo ga to o i ne ne e</span></p><p begin="1:35.992" end="1:40.036" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.992" end="1:36.339">夜</span><span begin="1:36.339" end="1:36.680">の</span><span begin="1:36.680" end="1:37.183">雲</span><span begin="1:37.183" end="1:37.418">が</span><span begin="1:37.418" end="1:37.841">高い</span><span begin="1:37.841" end="1:38.127">こ</span><span begin="1:38.127" end="1:38.245">と、</span><span begin="1:38.245" end="1:38.593">本</span><span begin="1:38.593" end="1:38.870">当不</span><span begin="1:38.870" end="1:39.157">思</span><span begin="1:39.157" end="1:39.301">議</span><span begin="1:39.301" end="1:40.036">だよ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜空云朵的高阔 真的很不可思议呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yo ru no ku mo ga ta ka i ko to, hon to u fu shi gi da yo</span></p><p begin="1:41.951" end="1:45.612" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.951" end="1:42.120">だ</span><span begin="1:42.120" end="1:42.292">か</span><span begin="1:42.292" end="1:42.426">ら</span><span begin="1:42.426" end="1:42.824">さ、</span><span begin="1:43.122" end="1:43.916">もう</span><span begin="1:43.916" end="1:44.244">い</span><span begin="1:44.244" end="1:44.567">い</span><span begin="1:44.567" end="1:44.935">ん</span><span begin="1:44.935" end="1:45.293">だ</span><span begin="1:45.293" end="1:45.612">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以啊 已经没关系了啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">da ka ra sa, mo u i in da yo</span></p><p begin="2:07.880" end="2:13.195" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.880" end="2:08.231">幽</span><span begin="2:08.231" end="2:08.596">霊</span><span begin="2:08.596" end="2:08.836">に</span><span begin="2:08.836" end="2:09.156">なっ</span><span begin="2:09.156" end="2:09.276">た</span><span begin="2:09.276" end="2:09.662">僕</span><span begin="2:09.662" end="2:10.067">は、</span><span begin="2:10.310" end="2:10.546">あ</span><span begin="2:10.546" end="2:10.717">の</span><span begin="2:10.717" end="2:11.054">頃</span><span begin="2:11.054" end="2:11.286">の</span><span begin="2:11.286" end="2:11.634">景</span><span begin="2:11.634" end="2:11.773">色</span><span begin="2:11.773" end="2:11.999">を</span><span begin="2:11.999" end="2:12.141">見</span><span begin="2:12.141" end="2:12.483">に行</span><span begin="2:12.483" end="2:12.825">くん</span><span begin="2:12.825" end="2:13.195">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已是幽灵的我 要去看那时候的景色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yu u re i ni na tta bo ku wa, a no ko ro no ke shi ki wo mi ni i kun da</span></p><p begin="2:13.522" end="2:15.418" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.522" end="2:13.852">遠</span><span begin="2:13.852" end="2:14.086">い</span><span begin="2:14.086" end="2:14.451">街</span><span begin="2:14.451" end="2:14.615">の</span><span begin="2:14.615" end="2:14.925">海</span><span begin="2:14.925" end="2:15.418">辺</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">遥远小镇的海边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to o i ma chi no u mi be</span></p><p begin="2:16.242" end="2:18.824" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.242" end="2:16.359">子</span><span begin="2:16.359" end="2:16.683">供</span><span begin="2:16.683" end="2:16.926">の</span><span begin="2:16.926" end="2:17.037">と</span><span begin="2:17.037" end="2:17.223">き</span><span begin="2:17.223" end="2:17.364">見</span><span begin="2:17.364" end="2:17.599">た</span><span begin="2:17.599" end="2:17.737">露</span><span begin="2:17.737" end="2:18.478">店</span><span begin="2:18.478" end="2:18.824">街</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孩童时期发现的地摊街</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ko do mo no to ki mi ta ro ten ga i</span></p><p begin="2:19.160" end="2:21.443" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.160" end="2:19.502">歩</span><span begin="2:19.502" end="2:19.749">き</span><span begin="2:19.749" end="2:20.067">疲</span><span begin="2:20.067" end="2:20.391">れ</span><span begin="2:20.391" end="2:20.581">た</span><span begin="2:20.581" end="2:20.955">脚</span><span begin="2:20.955" end="2:21.443">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">荡着疲惫的双脚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a ru ki tsu ka re ta a shi de</span></p><p begin="2:21.626" end="2:24.481" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.626" end="2:21.857">そ</span><span begin="2:21.857" end="2:22.002">こ</span><span begin="2:22.002" end="2:22.343">ら</span><span begin="2:22.343" end="2:22.589">の</span><span begin="2:22.589" end="2:22.929">ベン</span><span begin="2:22.929" end="2:23.070">チ</span><span begin="2:23.070" end="2:23.279">で</span><span begin="2:23.279" end="2:23.364">バ</span><span begin="2:23.364" end="2:23.632">ス</span><span begin="2:23.632" end="2:23.773">を</span><span begin="2:23.773" end="2:24.123">待っ</span><span begin="2:24.123" end="2:24.481">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那长椅上等着巴士</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so ko ra no ben chi de ba su wo ma tte</span></p><p begin="2:24.753" end="2:26.669" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.753" end="2:25.019">そ</span><span begin="2:25.019" end="2:25.213">の</span><span begin="2:25.213" end="2:25.547">後</span><span begin="2:25.547" end="2:25.792">は</span><span begin="2:25.792" end="2:26.060">どう</span><span begin="2:26.060" end="2:26.235">し</span><span begin="2:26.235" end="2:26.669">よう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那之后怎么办呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so no a to wa do u shi yo u</span></p><p begin="2:27.151" end="2:29.458" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:27.151" end="2:27.544">何</span><span begin="2:27.544" end="2:27.693">で</span><span begin="2:27.693" end="2:28.209">歩い</span><span begin="2:28.209" end="2:28.391">て</span><span begin="2:28.391" end="2:28.671">たん</span><span begin="2:28.671" end="2:28.930">だ</span><span begin="2:28.930" end="2:29.458">ろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么会一直走着呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nan de a ru i te tan da ro u</span></p><p begin="2:31.906" end="2:36.864" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:31.906" end="2:33.301">何</span><span begin="2:33.301" end="2:33.825">も</span><span begin="2:33.825" end="2:34.705">知</span><span begin="2:34.705" end="2:35.392">ら</span><span begin="2:35.392" end="2:35.804">な</span><span begin="2:35.804" end="2:36.024">く</span><span begin="2:36.024" end="2:36.446">たっ</span><span begin="2:36.446" end="2:36.864">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便什么都无法知道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na ni mo shi ra na ku ta tte</span></p><p begin="2:37.513" end="2:42.480" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:37.513" end="2:38.891">何</span><span begin="2:38.891" end="2:39.583">も</span><span begin="2:39.583" end="2:40.337">聞</span><span begin="2:40.337" end="2:41.028">け</span><span begin="2:41.028" end="2:41.440">な</span><span begin="2:41.440" end="2:41.640">く</span><span begin="2:41.640" end="2:42.134">たっ</span><span begin="2:42.134" end="2:42.480">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便什么都无法听到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na ni mo ki ke na ku ta tte</span></p><p begin="2:43.176" end="2:48.860" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.176" end="2:43.866">い</span><span begin="2:43.866" end="2:44.587">つ</span><span begin="2:44.587" end="2:45.254">か</span><span begin="2:45.254" end="2:46.666">君</span><span begin="2:46.666" end="2:47.215">が</span><span begin="2:47.215" end="2:48.128">忘</span><span begin="2:48.128" end="2:48.480">れ</span><span begin="2:48.480" end="2:48.678">て</span><span begin="2:48.678" end="2:48.860">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天你会忘怀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i tsu ka ki mi ga wa su re te mo</span></p><p begin="2:49.001" end="2:53.074" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:49.001" end="2:49.522">そ</span><span begin="2:49.522" end="2:49.862">れ</span><span begin="2:49.862" end="2:50.082">で</span><span begin="2:50.082" end="2:50.918">も</span><span begin="2:50.918" end="2:51.280">見</span><span begin="2:51.280" end="2:51.665">てい</span><span begin="2:51.665" end="2:52.326">る</span><span begin="2:52.326" end="2:52.688">か</span><span begin="2:52.688" end="2:53.074">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便这样我也会注视着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so re de mo mi te i ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="2:54.422" end="2:59.351" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:54.422" end="2:54.801">夏</span><span begin="2:54.801" end="2:55.040">の</span><span begin="2:55.040" end="2:55.494">陰</span><span begin="2:55.494" end="2:55.652">に</span><span begin="2:55.652" end="2:56.236">座っ</span><span begin="2:56.236" end="2:59.351">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坐于夏阴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na tsu no ka ge ni su wa tte</span></p><p begin="3:00.706" end="3:05.773" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:00.706" end="3:01.036">入</span><span begin="3:01.036" end="3:01.387">道</span><span begin="3:01.387" end="3:01.879">雲</span><span begin="3:01.879" end="3:02.218">を</span><span begin="3:02.218" end="3:02.595">眺</span><span begin="3:02.595" end="3:02.798">め</span><span begin="3:02.798" end="3:02.953">る</span><span begin="3:02.953" end="3:03.248">だ</span><span begin="3:03.248" end="3:03.533">け</span><span begin="3:03.533" end="3:03.649">で</span><span begin="3:03.649" end="3:03.854">ど</span><span begin="3:03.854" end="3:04.008">こ</span><span begin="3:04.008" end="3:04.219">か</span><span begin="3:04.219" end="3:04.580">苦</span><span begin="3:04.580" end="3:05.010">し</span><span begin="3:05.010" end="3:05.413">く</span><span begin="3:05.413" end="3:05.773">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是眺望积雨云而已某处便会感到痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nyu u do u gu mo wo na ga me ru da ke de do ko ka ku ru shi ku te</span></p><p begin="3:06.278" end="3:10.734" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.278" end="3:06.717">空</span><span begin="3:06.717" end="3:07.016">が</span><span begin="3:07.016" end="3:07.515">高い</span><span begin="3:07.515" end="3:09.629">よ</span> <span begin="3:09.629" end="3:09.897">ね</span><span begin="3:09.897" end="3:10.734">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天空真高呢 呐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so ra ga ta ka i yo ne e</span></p><p begin="3:11.970" end="3:16.033" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:11.970" end="3:12.131">こ</span><span begin="3:12.131" end="3:12.355">の</span><span begin="3:12.355" end="3:12.704">ま</span><span begin="3:12.704" end="3:12.836">ま</span><span begin="3:12.836" end="3:13.150">ずっ</span><span begin="3:13.150" end="3:13.417">と</span><span begin="3:13.417" end="3:13.745">遠</span><span begin="3:13.745" end="3:13.890">く</span><span begin="3:13.890" end="3:14.219">に行</span><span begin="3:14.219" end="3:14.458">け</span><span begin="3:14.458" end="3:14.570">た</span><span begin="3:14.570" end="3:14.834">ら</span><span begin="3:14.834" end="3:15.148">いい</span>