ey="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:08.547" end="5:08.833">そ</span><span begin="5:08.833" end="5:08.988">の</span><span begin="5:08.988" end="5:09.313">後</span><span begin="5:09.313" end="5:09.551">は</span><span begin="5:09.551" end="5:09.936">どう</span><span begin="5:09.936" end="5:10.057">だ</span><span begin="5:10.057" end="5:10.475">ろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那之后会怎样呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so no a to wa do u da ro u</span></p><p begin="5:10.858" end="5:12.855" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:10.858" end="5:11.257">きっ</span><span begin="5:11.257" end="5:11.390">と</span><span begin="5:11.390" end="5:11.816">君</span><span begin="5:11.816" end="5:11.953">に</span><span begin="5:11.953" end="5:12.088">は</span><span begin="5:12.088" end="5:12.333">見</span><span begin="5:12.333" end="5:12.482">え</span><span begin="5:12.482" end="5:12.855">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一定也无法看见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki tto ki mi ni wa mi e na i</span></p></div></body></tt>